{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","卡夫拉"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名果敢的战士，会毫不犹豫地冲向面前的敌人。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","随时听候吩咐！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Forever at your service."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","丛林见证成长。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The forest bears witness to growth."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","丛林之风，迅捷一击！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","As sudden and strong as a forest storm."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","托付给你们了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I'm placing my trust in you... Arghhh..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","丛林祝福着吾等！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","May the forest bless us all."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","风之卫士，受召！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","丛林之守护者，利剑在此。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","羽毛纷落。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","疲憊，谁？舞会警戒。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","此物——此物定为您精心挑选，吾必当用心守护！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","感谢您的赏识，此乃吾之荣幸！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我不需要椅子，谢谢"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","味道不错啊……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","烤串？那是什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","积雪之树……奇异"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","吾，节日也不放松警惕！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","鲜亮似火！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","注意防火！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","卡夫拉说话语气很凶，本来是工作职务的需求，但现在成为了个人习惯。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","卡夫拉其实相当喜欢小孩子。因此经常造访翡湖学校，但由于语气冷酷，不受欢迎。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","卡夫拉喜欢人多的地方，但很少有机会参与各种活动，因为通常负责担任守卫，他几乎没有完整参与过荆棘的任何重要活动。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","当帕瑞莎陷入低迷时，卡夫拉很担心，却不知如何开口。因此只能在心里不断地为帕瑞莎加油。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","卡夫拉会站着睡觉。他的这项特殊能力在威慑和执勤中起了重要作用。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","当压力太大，卡夫拉会找一片无人的空地奔跑，迎接生活的喜悦！之后，他会静静地梳理自己的毛发，这能让他平静下来。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","卡夫拉其实十分希望有人能帮助自己梳理毛发，但苦于没有合适的人选。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","卡夫拉饱读诗书，但他似乎从来不会把书中的社交技巧恰当地用在生活中。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","曾经有大胆的队员问卡夫拉的族群是卵生还是胎生。见识过那个队员的下场后，没人再敢问这个问题了。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","卡夫拉对埃隆从外界游历习得的剑术很感兴趣，但迄今为止还没有机会和埃隆进行一对一的切磋较量。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","之前第四小队提交过报告，希望能增配人手……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415024.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎 & 卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","我不需要椅子，谢谢"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415118.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","烤串？那是什么？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415119.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","积雪之树……奇异"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415427.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","吾，节日也不放松警惕！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415428.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","鲜亮似火！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415601.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","注意防火！"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415602.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","咕唔！汝竟与吾如此相像！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415703.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","卡夫拉 & 赞东"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","没想到，我们好不容易再见面，却是在这样的情况下……"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412030.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎 & 莱卡 & 卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","诸位！"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412040.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","卡夫拉 & 满满 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","卡夫拉，你的剑术十分了得。"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412120.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 卡夫拉 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","无论看到多少次，卡夫拉这把大剑的威慑力还是很强……"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412170.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 卡夫拉 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"]]}